{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764042,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Vortexa 3.0 12-Hour Hackathon","festival_id":null,"organization_id":1737842,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-11T21:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/vortexa-30-12-hour-hackathon-drdypatil-institute-of-technology-pimpri-pune-1764042","region":"offline","details":"<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7ecd5d55-5ba1-4a89-a54a-6a0e68abe11c\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"fbskMG_root LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"rylqng\" data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"291\"><strong>Vortexa 3.0 - 12-Hour Hackathon<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"320\"><strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"320\">Build. Innovate. Solve.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"499\">Vortexa 3.0 Is a 12-Hour Offline Hackathon Bringing Together Students, Developers, Innovators, and Problem-Solvers to Build Technology-Driven Solutions to Real-World Challenges.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"692\">Hosted at <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"568\">Dr. D. Y. Patil Institute of Technology, Pimpri, Pune<\/strong>, Vortexa Is Designed for Teams Who Want to Turn Ideas Into Working Prototypes Within a High-Energy 12-Hour Build Challenge.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"898\">Whether You're Into Ai\/ml, Web Development, App Development, Data Science, Automation, or Emerging Technologies, Vortexa Gives You the Opportunity to Build, Collaborate, Compete, and Showcase Your Skills.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1rkcpbz\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"915\"><strong>Why Vortexa?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<li data-section-id=\"178p5lu\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"967\">12 Hours of Intense Building and Problem-Solving<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r12tgg\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"999\">Real-World Problem Statements<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pcutdw\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1023\">Team-Based Innovation<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fsycin\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1073\">Mentorship and Interaction with Fellow Builders<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q1hrbj\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1096\">Evaluation by Judges<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9uqsux\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1135\">Opportunity to Showcase Your Project<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17s91ux\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1179\">Certificates and Prizes for Winning Teams<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"o9k3j6\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1229\">An On-Campus Hackathon Experience at Dit Pimpri<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"jw1hez\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1247\"><strong>Event Details<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1259\">Venue:<\/strong> dr. D. Y. Patil Institute of Technology, Pimpri, Pune<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1350\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1331\">Event Dates:<\/strong> 10&ndash;11 October 2026<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1378\">Hackathon Duration:<\/strong> 12 Hours<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1403\">Team Size:<\/strong> 2&ndash;4 Members<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1432\">Prize Pool:<\/strong> up to \u20b975,000*<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1466\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1458\">Mode:<\/strong> Offline<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"175eubl\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1497\"><strong>Two-Day Event Breakdown<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"11umom\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1538\"><strong><span role=\"text\">10 October 2026 - Hackathon Day<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1601\">The First Day Will Be Dedicated to The <strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1600\">12-Hour Hackathon<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1790\">\n<li data-section-id=\"6j4nyj\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1635\">Team Check-In and Verification<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xvckx2\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1654\">Opening Briefing<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"n19v7g\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1683\">Problem Statement Briefing<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"94m57n\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1703\">Problem Selection<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gp6jmw\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1738\">12-Hour Development and Building<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1iasm0k\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1763\">Testing and Refinement<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1h9e655\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1790\">Final Project Submission<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1871\">\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1871\">Lunch Will Be Provided to Registered Participants During the Hackathon.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"123h10c\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1919\"><strong><span role=\"text\">11 October 2026 - Evaluation &amp; Results<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2004\">The Second Day Will Focus on Evaluating the Solutions Built by Participating Teams.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2162\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1p8zsw5\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2048\">Project Presentations and Demonstrations<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vki9ti\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2082\">Evaluation by The Judging Panel<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vkwpn2\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2115\">Final Scoring and Deliberation<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4qd5s\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2141\"><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2141\">Result Announcement<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"zm66me\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2162\">Prize Distribution<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2228\"><strong data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2228\">Participants Should Be Available for Both Days of The Event.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"53jl9u\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2253\">Who Can Participate?<\/h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2354\">Vortexa Is Open to Students and Technology Enthusiasts Interested in Building Innovative Solutions.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2442\">Participants from Different Colleges, Branches, and Technical Backgrounds Are Welcome.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2493\">You Can Participate as A Team of <strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2492\">2-4 Members<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"18indsm\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2505\"><strong>Domains<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2578\">Teams Can Explore Problem Statements Across Technology Domains Such As:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2689\">\n<li data-section-id=\"106dv4c\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2624\">Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihirfv\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2642\">Web Development<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p5h0ok\" data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2665\">Software Development<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1i7pl00\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2689\">Emerging Technologies<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2772\">The Final Domains and Problem Statements Will Be Provided by The Organizing Team.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"7cpmdm\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3593\"><strong>Judging Criteria<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3624\">Projects May Be Evaluated On:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3788\">\n<li data-section-id=\"zno41x\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3638\">Innovation<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyomg9\" data-start=\"3639\" data-end=\"3665\">Technical Implementation<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qwiu1u\" data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3685\">Problem Relevance<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1r892kq\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3694\">Impact<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"msggfn\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3708\">Feasibility<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2pygnb\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3726\">User Experience<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6e082r\" data-start=\"3727\" data-end=\"3757\">Completeness of The Solution<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3oxzx\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3788\">Presentation &amp; Demonstration<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3862\">The Final Scoring Framework Will Be Communicated by The Organizing Team.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"uo2zpg\" data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3880\"><strong>What to Bring<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3908\">Participants Should Carry:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"4010\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1pa4k8u\" data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3918\">Laptop<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6g5jgg\" data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3928\">Charger<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w4kes8\" data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3961\">Required Development Equipment<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tvijim\" data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"3974\">College Id<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mn3jln\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"4010\">Registration\/confirmation Details<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4070\">Teams Are Responsible for Their Own Development Equipment.<\/p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"i2dsbc\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4107\">After Successful Registration<\/h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4343\">Once Your Team Successfully Completes the Registration Process, <strong data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4343\">All Important Event-Related Information and Further Instructions Will Be Communicated to The Registered Team Through the Contact Details Provided During Registration.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4384\">This May Include Information Regarding:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4599\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1o6hsj5\" data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4421\">Event Schedule and Reporting Time<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15k6bjd\" data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4455\">Venue and Check-In Instructions<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hvosph\" data-start=\"4456\" data-end=\"4476\">Problem Statements<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ceja0i\" data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4499\">Hackathon Guidelines<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2cj9qj\" data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4520\">Submission Process<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mnlkh4\" data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4558\">Presentation and Evaluation Process<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19wq78c\" data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4599\">Other Important Event-Day Instructions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4722\">Participants Are Advised to Regularly Check Their Registered Email and Other Official Communication Channels for Updates.<\/p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"96r18j\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4736\">Important<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"5404\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1srbtri\" data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4786\">Each Participant Can Be Part of Only One Team.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fx9ler\" data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4838\">Team Size Must Remain Within the Announced Limit.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"x6gjqj\" data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4896\">Participants Must Complete Venue Verification\/check-In.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lpwcar\" data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4967\">Participants Should Be Available on <strong data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"4966\">Both 10 and 11 October 2026<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10qulc1\" data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"5043\">Teams Must Submit Their Project Before the Announced Submission Deadline.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hprut8\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5129\">Plagiarism or Submission of Substantially Copied Work May Lead to Disqualification.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m9zw67\" data-start=\"5130\" data-end=\"5232\">Participants Must Follow the Event Code of Conduct and Instructions Provided by The Organizing Team.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lwln9k\" data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5339\">The Organizing Committee Reserves the Right to Modify the Schedule or Event Instructions when Necessary.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rt4der\" data-start=\"5340\" data-end=\"5404\">Final Decisions of The Judging Panel Will Be Treated as Final.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":20168682,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T10:48:22+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-07T00:32:12+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderbo